            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My father, a bartender at one time, always served these with a sprinkle of nutmeg on top. Christmas and New Year's Eves tradition in our family."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TimidStove9269"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mother found that recipe to be too strong. I wound up putting two or three times the amount of cream in it. Eventually, I substituted a nice vanilla ice cream for the ice and the heavy cream. Everyone seemed happy. And do not forget the fresh grated nutmeg!",
            "datePublished": "2024-12-21T23:08:05.559Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Erik Pratt"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Much too sweet. These types of spirit/liquer drinks need a 2:1 pour. Of course, drink what you like but everyone should start with a 2:1 (or even 3:1) ratio and adjust from there.",
            "datePublished": "2025-05-09T18:31:50.711Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JoyfulStir4978"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I put in kahlua instead of creme de cacao. Pour it over a large ice cube, then add brandy poured over the back of a spoon so it separates, then add cream poured over a spoon again so it floats. Sprinkle nutmeg to garnish. Serve with a straw. Enjoy!",
            "datePublished": "2024-08-15T15:19:12.379Z"
          }
